# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Production env template — F19.1
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.production (gitignored) before running
# `npm run build`. Validated at boot by src/lib/env.ts —
# a missing REQUIRED value renders the "Misconfigured deploy"
# screen instead of mounting React.
#
# CRA inlines REACT_APP_* at build time. Changing a value here
# requires a rebuild, NOT a redeploy of the existing bundle.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# REQUIRED — backend API base URL. No trailing slash.
# Example: https://api.amber-esol.example.com
REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL=

# OPTIONAL — uncomment if you wire client-side error reporting
# to a Sentry / Bugsnag / etc. DSN. See F19.2 follow-up note in
# docs/PRE_LAUNCH_CHECKLIST.md.
# REACT_APP_SENTRY_DSN=

# OPTIONAL — override the cookie domain used by the shared-SSO
# auth layer. Defaults to the deployed origin. Set to e.g.
# `.amber-esol.example.com` if running multiple subdomains.
# REACT_APP_COOKIE_DOMAIN=
